Beforehand: $\underbrace{2}_{\text{massless vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{2}_{\text{complex scalar}}
  =4.$ A massless vector has two transverse polarizations. The complex scalar has two real components, radial and angular.

u.src:
Beforehand: $\underbrace{2}_{\text{massless vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{2}_{\text{complex scalar}}
  =4.$ A massless vector has two transverse polarizations. The complex scalar has two real components, radial and angular.

en:
Beforehand: $\underbrace{2}_{\text{massless vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{2}_{\text{complex scalar}}
  =4.$ A massless vector has two transverse polarizations. The complex scalar has two real components, radial and angular.

ja:
以前： $\underbrace{2}_{\text{massless vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{2}_{\text{complex scalar}}
  =4.$ 質量のないベクトルは2つの横偏極を持つ。複素スカラーは動径成分と角度成分という2つの実成分を持つ。

zh:
之前： $\underbrace{2}_{\text{massless vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{2}_{\text{complex scalar}}
  =4.$ 无质量矢量有两个横向极化。复标量有两个实分量，即径向分量和角向分量。

p.src:
Afterward: $\underbrace{3}_{\text{massive vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{1}_{\text{radial Higgs}}
  =4.$ A massive vector can be brought to rest. In its rest frame no spatial direction is privileged, so it must have three polarization states. When it moves, two are transverse and one is longitudinal. The Goldstone mode has become that longitudinal polarization.

